      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This article has described symptom perception and its relation to asthma management. Underestimation of airway obstruction in persons with asthma is a common and serious problem that is linked to fatalities in persons with asthma. Strategies to identify and manage the poor perceiver have been suggested."},
